# Online Prediction Server with ZGC (Java 17+, low-latency experiment)
#
# Use for high-QPS online serving when STW pause outliers hurt tail latency.
# Validate CPU headroom before production use; concurrent GC work is not free.
-Xms768m
-Xmx1536m
-Xss512k
-XX:SoftMaxHeapSize=1024m
-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=320m
-XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=160m
-XX:MaxDirectMemorySize=256m
-XX:+UseZGC
-XX:ZUncommitDelay=300
-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError
-XX:HeapDumpPath=logs/online-serving-zgc.hprof
-XX:ErrorFile=logs/hs_err_online-serving-zgc_pid%p.log
-Xlog:gc*,safepoint:file=logs/gc-online-serving-zgc-%p.log:time,uptime,level,tags:filecount=5,filesize=20M
